{"id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-inductive-depth.md","title":"归纳深度","display":"df-inductive-depth — 归纳深度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-inductive-depth","aliases":["29-df-inductive-depth"],"display":"df-inductive-depth — 归纳深度","depends_on":["[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-thm-finite-lfp]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-positivity]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 4.13, p.62, DjVu scan 77","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-inductive-depth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-inductive-depth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive-depth — 归纳深度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef09f4563b20da8e\" href=\"?note=ef09f4563b20da8e\" title=\"29-thm-finite-lfp\">29-thm-finite-lfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0d59539a54286933\" href=\"?note=0d59539a54286933\" title=\"29-df-positivity\">29-df-positivity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 4.13, p.62, DjVu scan 77"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span> 元关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 分量各异。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\\)</span>；除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 外的自由变量作为固定参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；赋值和 FO 满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 在下面构造为给定绑定关系及变量组的空初态迭代。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}\">\\(\\operatorname{card}\\)</span> 是有限集合的基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\">\\(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{ar}(R)\">\\(k=\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}]\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\quad i\\in\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}]\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\quad i\\in\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\leq\\operatorname{card}(|A|)^k,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq n^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\leq\\operatorname{card}(|A|)^k,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq n^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.13，印刷页 62，扫描页 77。对无额外参数的体，第一式与原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\{i:R_i=R_{i+1}\\}\">\\(\\min\\{i:R_i=R_{i+1}\\}\\)</span> 相同；增加对固定参数赋值取最大值，使 IND 中的资源界覆盖所有参数。最大值存在：相关参数赋值只有有限种，深度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,n^k\">\\(0,\\ldots,n^k\\)</span> 内的整数。非空结构约定来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a>。</p>\n<p>本轮把绑定数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,\\bar x\">\\(R,\\bar x\\)</span> 纳入全部深度签名，不能只用公式体的字面形式决定迭代。反例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=R(x)\\lor x=y\">\\(\\varphi=R(x)\\lor x=y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 一元且域至少两元；绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>、固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 时一轮稳定，绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>、固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 时两轮稳定。迭代构造也显式携带绑定数据，避免复用丢失参数的缩写。正性使更新算子单调，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ef09f4563b20da8e\" href=\"?note=ef09f4563b20da8e\" title=\"29-thm-finite-lfp\">29-thm-finite-lfp</a> 给出最小稳定阶段存在及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^k\">\\(n^k\\)</span> 上界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-finite-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-finite-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-positivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status"