orname{ar}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"Z_0^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in|A|^k\\mid A[R:=Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}]\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x]]\\},\\quad i\\in\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid Z_i^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=Z_{i+1}^{A,\\beta,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_{A,\\beta}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\leq\\operatorname{card}(|A|)^k,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq n^k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\min\\{i:R_i=R_{i+1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,n^k","display":false},{"tex":"R,\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=R(x)\\lor x=y","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"n^k","display":false}],"bytes":3088,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)$ 见 [[29-df-inductive-depth]]；绑定关系 $R$ 和变量组 $\\bar x$ 是资源签名的必要参数。语义取 [[29-df-fo-lfp]] 的 $\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}$。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-inductive-depth]]"}],"outgoing":["ac5c4072279f0088","3ee556c64b16809b","ef09f4563b20da8e","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","4de8e0c8085801f5","0d59539a54286933","0ac4b9a122d458e2"]}